# ============================================================
# GitHub Linguist 仓库语言统计精细化控制 (.gitattributes)
# ============================================================

# 1. 忽略超大数据源与构建产物
specs/** linguist-vendored
docs/public/** linguist-vendored
docs/.vitepress/sidebar-*.json linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated

# 2. 避免生成的批量接口文档垄断统计
docs/seller/** linguist-documentation
docs/performance/** linguist-documentation
docs/ru/seller/** linguist-documentation
docs/ru/performance/** linguist-documentation
docs/en/seller/** linguist-documentation
docs/en/performance/** linguist-documentation

# 3. 核心 Markdown 启用检测
README.md linguist-detectable
docs/index.md linguist-detectable
docs/changelog.md linguist-detectable
docs/ru/index.md linguist-detectable
docs/en/index.md linguist-detectable
docs/seller/index.md linguist-detectable
docs/performance/index.md linguist-detectable

# 4. 显式开启组件与主题代码
components/** linguist-detectable
docs/.vitepress/theme/** -linguist-vendored
docs/.vitepress/theme/** linguist-detectable
